    "Comma-separated patterns. Files are saved immediately; open documents are skipped.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comma-separated patterns. Files are saved immediately; open documents are skipped."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用英文逗号分隔匹配规则。文件将立即保存，跳过已打开的文档。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Command-F finds text; Command-D adds the next occurrence. Command-Option-click adds a caret. Use Column Selection for rectangular editing.\n\nRegex uses Apple's ICU syntax and $1 replacement groups. Large files and hexadecimal views are read-only. File recovery copies never automatically overwrite the original.\n\nmacOS 27 uses system text-selection gestures and navigation tabs. macOS 15 and 26 use fewer custom animations.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Command-F finds text; Command-D adds the next occurrence. Command-Option-click adds a caret. Use Column Selection for rectangular editing.\n\nRegex uses Apple's ICU syntax and $1 replacement groups. Large files and hexadecimal views are read-only. File recovery copies never automatically overwrite the original.\n\nmacOS 27 uses system text-selection gestures and navigation tabs. macOS 15 and 26 use fewer custom animations."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Command-F 查找文本；Command-D 添加下一个匹配项。按住 Command-Option 并点击可添加光标。使用“矩形选择”进行列编辑。\n\n正则表达式采用 Apple 的 ICU 语法，使用 $1 等引用替换捕获组。大文件和十六进制视图为只读模式。恢复副本不会自动覆盖原文件。\n\nmacOS 27 使用系统文本选择手势和导航标签；macOS 15 和 26 使用较少的自定义动画。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
